  "question": "求方程 $x^{2}\\sin\\frac{1}{x}=2x-501$ 的近似解，精确到 0.001.",
  "answer": "x=501 是满足题设条件的解.",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "泰勒公式",
    "极值"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 为求得满足题设条件的近似解，只需将 $\\sin \\frac{1}{x}$ 做一阶泰勒展开，并估计其误差."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "由泰勒公式 $\\sin t = t - \\frac{\\sin(\\theta t)}{2} t^2 (0 < \\theta < 1)$ ，令 $t = \\frac{1}{x}$ ，得"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "$$\n\\sin \\frac {1}{x} = \\frac {1}{x} - \\frac {\\sin \\left(\\frac {\\theta}{x}\\right)}{2 x ^ {2}},\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "代入原方程，得"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "$$\nx - \\frac {1}{2} \\sin \\left(\\frac {\\theta}{x}\\right) = 2 x - 5 0 1, \\text {即} x = 5 0 1 - \\frac {1}{2} \\sin \\left(\\frac {\\theta}{x}\\right).\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "由此知 $x > 500$ ， $0 <   \\frac{\\theta}{x} <  \\frac{1}{500}$ ，则有"
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "text": "$$\n\\left| x - 5 0 1 \\right| = \\frac {1}{2} \\left| \\sin \\left(\\frac {\\theta}{x}\\right) \\right| \\leqslant \\frac {1}{2} \\frac {\\theta}{x} <   \\frac {1}{1 0 0 0} = 0. 0 0 1.\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s8",
        "text": "所以 x=501 是满足题设条件的解."
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "x=501 是满足题设条件的解.",
